button><a class=\"nav-item \" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/settings.html\" data-nav-key=\"settings\" data-tooltip=\"管理会员资料、主题样式、登录安全与邀约记录。\" aria-description=\"管理会员资料、主题样式、登录安全与邀约记录。\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#settings\"></use></svg><span>个人设置</span></a></section><div class=\"nav-scroll-fade-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></nav>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-bottom\"><div class=\"sidebar-bottom-row\"><div class=\"mini-membership\" data-settings-link-ready=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"打开个人设置与⚙️ 账户与设置\" title=\"点击打开个人设置与⚙️ 账户与设置\"><div class=\"mini-avatar\" data-member-initial=\"\">何</div><div><span data-member-name=\"\">演示用户</span><small data-member-level=\"\">天使</small></div><a href=\"/creator-workbench/member/settings.html\" title=\"打开个人设置与⚙️ 账户与设置\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#chevron\"></use></svg></a></div>\n      <a class=\"help-button\" href=\"https://wxgaochu.feishu.cn/share/base/webpage/shrcnnUvrmhLammrlrw7Of8QUQf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#help\"></use></svg><span>使用帮助</span></a>\n      </div></div>\n  <div class=\"sidebar-resize-handle\" role=\"separator\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\" title=\"拖动调整菜单宽度\"></div></aside>\n  <main class=\"workspace-main\">\n    <header class=\"topbar\"><div class=\"topbar-left\"><button class=\"mobile-menu\" type=\"button\" data-open-sidebar=\"\" aria-label=\"打开菜单\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#menu\"></use></svg><b data-nav-mobile-alert=\"\" class=\"nav-alert mobile-menu-alert\" aria-label=\"5 条未读提醒\">5</b></button><div><span>BUSINESS MATURITY</span><div class=\"page-heading-row\"><h1>经营体检</h1><p class=\"page-intro\" data-page-note=\"\">找到当前最值得改善的经营环节。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"topbar-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"global-search-trigger\" data-open-search=\"\" aria-label=\"打开全站搜索\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#search\"></use></svg><span>搜索</span><kbd>⌘K</kbd></button><a class=\"back-dashboard\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/strategy-map.html\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#home\"></use></svg><span>返回经营地图</span></a></div></header>\n    <div class=\"growth-content\">\n      <section class=\"growth-intro\"><div><span>约3分钟 · 10个问题</span><h2>看清经营现状，找到下一步重点</h2><p>从产品、获客、成交和团队几个方面，看看哪些已经做稳、哪些还需要完善。先选择你的客户类型，再按真实情况作答。</p></div></section>\n      <form class=\"assessment-card\" data-assessment-form=\"\">\n        <section class=\"audience-selector\"><div><span>第一步 · 选择客户类型</span><h2>你目前主要服务哪类客户？</h2><p>系统会显示适合这类客户的经营问题。请选择当前最符合你业务的方向。</p></div><div class=\"audience-options\" data-audience-options=\"\"><label class=\"audience-option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audienceType\" value=\"consumer\"><span><strong>C端 个人客户</strong><small>客户以个人身份购买你的产品或服务。</small></span></label><label class=\"audience-option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audienceType\" value=\"business\"><span><strong>B端 企业/组织客户</strong><small>由企业或组织采购你的方案、服务或产品。</small></span></label><label class=\"audience-option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"audienceType\" value=\"hybrid\"><span><strong>两类客户都有</strong><small>同时服务个人与企业，需要兼顾两条经营路径。</small></span></label></div></section>\n        <div class=\"journey-question-heading\" data-question-heading=\"\"><div><h3>按你现在的实际情况选择</h3><p>点开题目即可回答；已选答案会显示在题目旁，方便回看和修改。</p></div><button class=\"secondary-action\" type=\"button\" data-expand-questions=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\">展开全部问题</button></div>\n        <div class=\"assessment-list\" data-questions=\"\"><details class=\"journey-question\" open=\"\"><summary><strong>01 我已经验证，目标客户愿意为我解决的核心问题付费。</strong><span class=\"journey-answer-state\">待选择</span></summary><fieldset class=\"assessment-question\"><legend class=\"journey-sr-only\">我已经验证，目标客户愿意为我解决的核心问题付费。</legend><div class=\"assessment-options\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_offer\" value=\"1\" required=\"\">还没有</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_offer\" value=\"2\" required=\"\">刚开始</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_offer\" value=\"3\" required=\"\">偶尔做到</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_offer\" value=\"4\" required=\"\">基本稳定</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_offer\" value=\"5\" required=\"\">已经系统化</label></div></fieldset></details><details class=\"journey-question\"><summary><strong>02 我至少有一个能够持续带来有效线索的获客渠道。</strong><span class=\"journey-answer-state\">待选择</span></summary><fieldset class=\"assessment-question\"><legend class=\"journey-sr-only\">我至少有一个能够持续带来有效线索的获客渠道。</legend><div class=\"assessment-options\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_acquisition\" value=\"1\" required=\"\">还没有</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_acquisition\" value=\"2\" required=\"\">刚开始</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_acquisition\" value=\"3\" required=\"\">偶尔做到</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_acquisition\" value=\"4\" required=\"\">基本稳定</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_acquisition\" value=\"5\" required=\"\">已经系统化</label></div></fieldset></details><details class=\"journey-question\"><summary><strong>03 我有相对稳定的咨询、成交和跟进流程。</strong><span class=\"journey-answer-state\">待选择</span></summary><fieldset class=\"assessment-question\"><legend class=\"journey-sr-only\">我有相对稳定的咨询、成交和跟进流程。</legend><div class=\"assessment-options\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_conversion\" value=\"1\" required=\"\">还没有</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_conversion\" value=\"2\" required=\"\">刚开始</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_conversion\" value=\"3\" required=\"\">偶尔做到</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_conversion\" value=\"4\" required=\"\">基本稳定</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_conversion\" value=\"5\" required=\"\">已经系统化</label></div></fieldset></details><details class=\"journey-question\"><summary><strong>04 我的核心产品或服务可以重复交付，并能产生案例。</strong><span class=\"journey-answer-state\">待选择</span></summary><fieldset class=\"assessment-question\"><legend class=\"journey-sr-only\">我的核心产品或服务可以重复交付，并能产生案例。</legend><div class=\"assessment-options\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_delivery\" value=\"1\" required=\"\">还没有</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_delivery\" value=\"2\" required=\"\">刚开始</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_delivery\" value=\"3\" required=\"\">偶尔做到</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_delivery\" value=\"4\" required=\"\">基本稳定</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_delivery\" value=\"5\" required=\"\">已经系统化</label></div></fieldset></details><details class=\"journey-question\"><summary><strong>05 高频工作已经沉淀为 SOP、模板、数据看板或智能体。</strong><span class=\"journey-answer-state\">待选择</span></summary><fieldset class=\"assessment-question\"><legend class=\"journey-sr-only\">高频工作已经沉淀为 SOP、模板、数据看板或智能体。</legend><div class=\"assessment-options\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_system\" value=\"1\" required=\"\">还没有</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_system\" value=\"2\" required=\"\">刚开始</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_system\" value=\"3\" required=\"\">偶尔做到</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_system\" value=\"4\" required=\"\">基本稳定</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"common_system\" value=\"5\" required=\"\">已经系统化</label></div></fieldset></details><details class=\"journey-question\"><summary><strong>06 我能明确目标企业的行业、规模、发展阶段和关键决策人。</strong><span class=\"journey-answer-state\">待选择</span></summary><fieldset class=\"assessment-question\"><legend class=\"journey-sr-only\">我能明确目标企业的行业、规模、发展阶段和关键决策人。</legend><div class=\"assessment-options\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b_icp\" value=\"1\" required=\"\">还没有</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b_icp\" value=\"2\" required=\"\">刚开始</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b_icp\" value=\"3\" required=\"\">偶尔做到</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b_icp\" value=\"4\" required=\"\">基本稳定</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b_icp\" value=\"5\" required=\"\">已经系统化</label></div></fieldset></details><details class=\"journey-question\"><summary><strong>07 我的方案能对应企业关心的收入、效率、成本或风险指标。</strong><span class=\"journey-answer-state\">待选择</span></summary><fieldset class=\"assessment-question\"><legend class=\"journey-sr-only\">我的方案能对应企业关心的收入、效率、成本或风险指标。</legend><div class=\"assessment-options\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b_metric\" value=\"1\" required=\"\">还没有</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b_metric\" value=\"2\" required=\"\">刚开始</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b_metric\" value=\"3\" required=\"\">偶尔做到</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b_metric\" value=\"4\" required=\"\">基本稳定</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b_metric\" value=\"5\" required=\"\">已经系统化</label></div></fieldset></details><details class=\"journey-question\"><summary><strong>08 我能通过案例、渠道合作或关键人关系持续获得企业商机。</strong><span class=\"journey-answer-state\">待选择</span></summary><fieldset class=\"assessment-question\"><legend class=\"journey-sr-only\">我能通过案例、渠道合作或关键人关系持续获得企业商机。</legend><div class=\"assessment-options\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b_leads\" value=\"1\" required=\"\">还没有</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b_leads\" value=\"2\" required=\"\">刚开始</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b_leads\" value=\"3\" required=\"\">偶尔做到</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b_leads\" value=\"4\" required=\"\">基本稳定</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b_leads\" value=\"5\" required=\"\">已经系统化</label></div></fieldset></details><details class=\"journey-question\"><summary><strong>09 我掌握从需求诊断、方案汇报到预算和采购决策的流程。</strong><span class=\"journey-answer-state\">待选择</span></summary><fieldset class=\"assessment-question\"><legend class=\"journey-sr-only\">我掌握从需求诊断、方案汇报到预算和采购决策的流程。</legend><div class=\"assessment-options\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"b_decision\" value=\"1\" r